[{:adr/status "accepted", :adr/id "adr-2607061640-kotoba-lang-dag-cbor-rename", :adr/doc_type "adr", :adr/repo ["orgs/kotoba-lang/org-ietf-cbor"], :adr/body "\n# ADR-2607061640: dag-cbor rename\n\n## 背景\n\nREADME で実体確認: \"Definite-length CBOR (RFC 8949) encode/decode — with\nboth a canonical (dag-cbor key-sorted) encoder and an order-preserving\none for signing payloads\" — 名前は \"dag-cbor\" だが、実際のスコープは\n**RFC 8949(CBOR)の一般的な実装**で、IPLD の dag-cbor 正規化はその一\nモードに過ぎない(CACAO の署名ペイロードには canonical でない\norder-preserving モードを使う、という記述がその根拠)。よって\n`io-ipld-dag-cbor` ではなく `org-ietf-cbor`(RFC 8949 = IETF文書)を選択。\nnamespace は元から `cbor.core` であり、リポジトリ名を変えても\n`cbor.core` の呼び出し側コードは無変更。\n\n## 依存グラフ調査\n\n`ed25519` と同時に依存するリポジトリが多い(cacao 経由の推移含む)。実\n依存4件:\n\n| repo | ファイル |\n|---|---|\n| `kotoba-lang/io-ipld`(旧ipld) | deps.edn |\n| `kotoba-lang/pqh` | deps.edn(ed25519 rename時に続けて更新) |\n| `gftdcojp/net-kotobase` | cli/deps.edn, cli/nbb.edn |\n| `kotoba-lang/cacao` | deps.edn, nbb.edn(rename後 21 tests/115 assertions green) |\n\n`etzhayyim/root` は ed25519 と同じ理由でスキップ。\n\n## 決定\n\n`kotoba-lang/dag-cbor` → `kotoba-lang/org-ietf-cbor`。手順は\nADR-2607061620 と同一。\n\n## 検証\n\n```\ngh api repos/kotoba-lang/org-ietf-cbor --jq '.full_name'\ncd io-ipld && clojure -M:test   # 7 tests / 21 assertions green\ncd cacao   && clojure -M:test   # 21 tests / 115 assertions green\nnbb scripts/gen-west-manifest.cljs --entry org-ietf-cbor\n```\n\n## Consequences\n\n- (+) 4つの実依存先の座標が canonical に。namespace(`cbor.core`)は無変更\n  なのでコード側の変更ゼロ。\n- 残る follow-up: `cacao` 自身の rename(ed25519/dag-cbor 両方の rename が\n  完了したので次に着手可能)。", :adr/decision "{:renamed {:old \"dag-cbor\", :new \"org-ietf-cbor\", :spec \"RFC 8949 (CBOR)\", :note \"name says dag-cbor but scope is general RFC 8949 CBOR with a dag-cbor-compatible canonical mode as one option (order-preserving mode used for CACAO signing payloads is NOT dag-cbor-conformant); namespace stays cbor.core, no code change\"}, :dependents-updated [\"kotoba-lang/io-ipld\" \"kotoba-lang/pqh\" \"gftdcojp/net-kotobase (cli/deps.edn + cli/nbb.edn)\" \"kotoba-lang/cacao (deps.edn + nbb.edn)\"], :dependents-skipped [{:repo \"etzhayyim/root\", :reason \"same as ed25519 rename (ADR-2607061620)\"}]}", :adr/date "2026-07-06", :db/id -1, :adr/builds_on ["90-docs/adr/2607061620-kotoba-lang-ed25519-rename.edn"], :adr/status_note "完了。cacao自身のrenameがfollow-up(ed25519/dag-cbor両方完了済みなので次に着手可能)。", :adr/authoritative true, :adr/verification "{:io-ipld {:command \"clojure -M:test\", :result \"7 tests / 21 assertions green\"}, :cacao {:command \"clojure -M:test\", :result \"21 tests / 115 assertions green\"}, :west {:command \"gen-west-manifest.cljs --entry org-ietf-cbor\", :result \"1件のpin変更を検証OK\"}}", :adr/title "dag-cbor -> org-ietf-cbor", :adr/source-format "edn"}]